  "description": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Proudly Introducing Lumimies LLC,</span><b></b></p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>The word Lumimies Translates to Abominable Snowman (Yeti) in the Finnish language.</span><b></b></p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Finland has a Beautiful View of the Aurora Borealis, some call it the Northern Lights. I&rsquo;d like it to be a big part of branding. I Feel Lumimies could be very appealing to a vast crowd; Currently working towards achieving more brand awareness.&nbsp;</span><b></b></p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>The Mission is to Provide Affordable Winter Luxuries, Variety of Services, and More, (Mostly relating to Winter). More Importantly, it&rsquo;s to become a Leader in Carbon Positivity / Eco Friendliness.&nbsp;</span><b></b></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\"><span>Inspire Collaboration, Innovation for Sustainable Practices Worldwide</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\"><span>Inspire People to Be More Environmentally Conscious</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\"><span>Push for Strict Regulations on Environmentally Unsustainable Practices</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>The most you could earn from a product sale would be from the Large Lumimies Blanket, $8.25 commission per unit.</span><b></b></p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Being a Lumimies Affiliate doesn't just mean Advertising on Social Media, I hope that the Community could help Lumimies in Growing to the point where our products are featured in most stores worldwide.&nbsp;</span><b></b></p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>This is a start up, I&rsquo;m offering future equity to anyone who would be a valuable member of Our team.&nbsp;</span><b></b></p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Current markets are USA, and Poland, I&rsquo;m open to suggestions.</span><b></b></p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>There is a secret niche that hasn't been tapped into yet, Think it'll be a Cash Cow soon upon release, stay tuned.&nbsp;</span><b id=\"docs-internal-guid-b835ad7c-7fff-a600-3934-dd062d7606c1\"></b></p>",
